    "Checking your move…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Prověřuji váš tah…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checkmate — the strongest possible finish." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mat — silnější zakončení neexistuje."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checkmate — you lost" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mat — prohráli jste"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checkmate is a check with no answer — and it ends the game on the spot. Below is the back-rank mate: the rook checks along the eighth rank, the black king cannot leave it, and his own pawns take away every escape square." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mat je šach, na který není odpověď — a partie okamžitě končí. Níže je mat na základní řadě: věž dává šach po osmé řadě, černý král ji nemůže opustit a vlastní pěšci mu berou každé únikové pole."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checkmate the computer with a knight." : {
      "comment" : "Achievement 'Knight's Tale': how to earn it. Replaces 'Deliver checkmate with a knight.' — two-player games no longer earn it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dejte počítači mat jezdcem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checkmate the computer with a pawn." : {
      "comment" : "Achievement 'Humble Hero': how to earn it. Replaces 'Deliver checkmate with a pawn.' — two-player games no longer earn it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dejte počítači mat pěšcem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checkmate the computer within 20 moves." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dejte počítači mat do 20 tahů."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checkmate wins" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mat vyhrává"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checkmate wins — and so does a king that reaches one of the four centre squares." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vyhrává mat — a také král, který dojde na jedno ze čtyř středových polí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checkmate wins — and so does the third check." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vyhrává mat — a také třetí šach."
