    "Hint asks the engine for the move it would play, in games against the computer; with two players that button offers a draw instead." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nápověda se zeptá enginu, jaký tah by zahrál, v partiích proti počítači; u dvou hráčů totéž tlačítko nabízí remízu."
