    "in check" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver value on the checked king's square",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "v šachu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In the first ten moves, aim to have every knight and bishop off its starting square and pointing at the centre. A piece at home does nothing, and material means little if your opponent's army is developed and yours is not." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "V prvních deseti tazích se snažte dostat každého jezdce a střelce z výchozího pole a namířit je do středu. Figura doma nedělá nic a materiál moc neznamená, když má soupeř vyvinutou armádu a vy ne."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In the game you played %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "V partii jste zahráli %@"
