            "value" : "Moje partie"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "My Games keeps the newest %lld imported games." : {
      "comment" : "After a PGN import that pushed older imports out; the number is always 300",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Moje partie uchovávají nejnovějších %lld naimportovaných partií."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nearly the engine's choice; %@ was a shade better." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Skoro volba enginu; %@ byl o chlup lepší."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Neither a game nor a position could be read from that." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Z toho se nedala přečíst partie ani pozice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Neither player can deliver checkmate." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ani jeden hráč už nemůže dát mat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Neither side has enough material left to mate." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ani jedné straně nezbyl materiál na mat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Neither the king nor that particular rook has moved yet." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Král ani ta konkrétní věž ještě netáhli."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Never played before? Start at the top. Nine short lessons cover every rule of the game." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nikdy jste nehráli? Začněte nahoře. Devět krátkých lekcí projde všechna pravidla hry."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New Best!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nový rekord!"
          }
