        }
      }
    },
    "No games could be read from that file." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Z toho souboru nešlo načíst žádnou partii."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No games could be read from those files." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Z těch souborů nešlo načíst žádnou partii."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No mistakes left to fix — review a game to find more." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Žádné chyby k opravě — další najdete v rozboru partie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No moves played" : {
      "comment" : "Stands in for the accuracy of a player who never got to move",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bez tahů"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No moves to review — this game ended before anyone played." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Není co analyzovat — partie skončila, než padl první tah."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No puzzle could be set up here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Žádnou úlohu se tu nepodařilo připravit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No verdict for this move." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pro tento tah není hodnocení."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not analyzed yet" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver value before the engine has answered",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zatím nerozebráno"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not enough material: king against king, or king and a single knight or bishop, cannot mate." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nedostatek materiálu: král proti králi, nebo král s jedním jezdcem či střelcem, nemůže dát mat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not in check, but nothing to play: a draw." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Není v šachu, ale nemá co hrát: remíza."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not the move. Try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To není ono. Zkuste to znovu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "not yet earned" : {
      "comment" : "Achievement state",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "zatím nezískáno"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "notation.pieceLetters" : {
      "comment" : "The five piece letters used when a move is written down, in the order king, queen, rook, bishop, knight — no separators. Czech chess writes KDVSJ (král, dáma, věž, střelec, jezdec).",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "KDVSJ"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "KQRBN"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "O-O is castling towards the h-file, O-O-O towards the a-file." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O-O je rošáda na stranu sloupce h, O-O-O na stranu sloupce a."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ocean" : {
      "comment" : "Board theme",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Oceán"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Odds" : {
      "comment" : "Starting position choice: one side plays without a piece",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fora"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "off" : {
      "comment" : "State of a switch",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "vypnuto"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OK" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "OK"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "on" : {
      "comment" : "State of a switch",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "zapnuto"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On one device" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Na jednom zařízení"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the clock a move is a move: Undo becomes Pause, and there are no hints." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Na čas platí, co je dáno: místo tahu zpět je pauza a nápověda není."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once per game each player may castle: the king steps two squares towards a rook and that rook hops over him to the other side. It is the only move that shifts two pieces at once, and it does two useful things — the king hides behind his pawns and the rook comes into play." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jednou za partii může každý hráč rošovat: král udělá dva kroky směrem k věži a ta přeskočí na jeho druhou stranu. Je to jediný tah, který hýbe dvěma figurami najednou, a dělá dvě užitečné věci — král se schová za své pěšce a věž se dostane do hry."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One number covers a move by each player: \"1.e4 e5\" is move one. When only Black's half is quoted it is written with dots, as in \"1...e5\". The strip under the board in this app lists the game exactly this way, newest move last." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jedno číslo pokrývá tah obou hráčů: „1.e4 e5“ je první tah. Když se cituje jen půlka černého, píše se s tečkami, třeba „1...e5“. Pruh pod šachovnicí v této aplikaci vypisuje partii přesně takhle, nejnovější tah vpravo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One side plays without a piece:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jedna strana hraje bez figury:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One step at a time — but in every direction." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vždy jen krok — zato všemi směry."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Otevřít"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open a game or a position from elsewhere" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
