            "value" : "Výchozí pozice"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "STARTING POSITION" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "VÝCHOZÍ POZICE"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Statistics" : {
      "comment" : "My Games tab",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Statistiky"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Step through the game to see how each move was judged." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Projděte partii tah po tahu a uvidíte hodnocení každého z nich."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Still being analyzed…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ještě se analyzuje…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Straight lines, any distance." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rovné linie, libovolná vzdálenost."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "STREAKS AND TIME" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SÉRIE A ČAS"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Survival" : {
      "comment" : "Puzzle rush kind: no clock, three strikes",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Přežití"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swipe the board, or tap a move in the strip, to walk through the game." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Partii projdete přejetím po šachovnici nebo klepnutím na tah v pruhu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tactician" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Taktik"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take as long as you like. Undo and hints are on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Přemýšlejte, jak dlouho chcete. Tah zpět i nápověda fungují."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take the centre" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Obsaďte střed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Taking a knight instead of a queen is rare, but it can come with a check that a queen would not give." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vzít si jezdce místo dámy je vzácné, ale může s sebou nést šach, který by dáma nedala."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap a dot to move the pawn." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klepnutím na tečku pěšcem táhnete."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap a piece and the dots show every square it may legally go to; tap one of them to play the move. Dragging the piece works too, and tapping it a second time puts it back down. Illegal moves are simply not offered, so you cannot go wrong." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klepněte na figuru a tečky ukážou každé pole, kam smí podle pravidel jít; klepnutím na tečku tah zahrajete. Funguje i tažení figury a druhé klepnutí ji zase položí. Nedovolené tahy se prostě nenabízejí, takže nemůžete udělat chybu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap e4 to open the game." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klepnutím na e4 zahájíte partii."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap e8: the pawn arrives and becomes a queen." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klepněte na e8: pěšec dojde a promění se v dámu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap g1 or c1: the king goes two squares, the rook lands on his other side." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klepněte na g1 nebo c1: král jde o dvě pole a věž přistane na jeho druhé straně."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap the knight: it is pinned and has no legal move." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klepněte na jezdce: je vázaný a nemá žádný možný tah."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That FEN does not describe a legal position." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tento FEN nepopisuje platnou pozici."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That is not the book move. Try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To není teoretický tah. Zkuste to znovu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The adaptive opponent is now: %@" : {
      "comment" : "Result card: where the adaptive opponent stands after the game",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adaptivní soupeř je teď na úrovni: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app shows the captured pieces and the material lead next to each player." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aplikace ukazuje u každého hráče sebrané figury a materiální náskok."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bishop" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Střelec"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bishop keeps to its own colour." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Střelec zůstává na své barvě."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Board" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Šachovnice"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The boards in the lessons are live: tap a piece's dots and the move really happens." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Šachovnice v lekcích jsou živé: klepněte na tečku u figury a tah se opravdu zahraje."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The buttons" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tlačítka"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The classic game of kings" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klasická hra králů"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The clock waits that many seconds before it starts to run. Nothing is ever added." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hodiny se rozběhnou až po uplynutí tolika sekund. Nic se nepřičítá."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The columns are called files and are lettered a to h." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sloupce se značí písmeny a až h."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The computer plays its move…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Počítač hraje svůj tah…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The computer plays its side of the line; you play yours. A line is learned once you play it through without a slip, and mastered after three." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Počítač hraje svou stranu varianty, vy tu svou. Variantu umíte, když ji jednou odehrajete bez chyby, a ovládáte ji po třech bezchybných průchodech."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The computer plays without:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Počítač hraje bez:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The computer's king took the hill" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Král počítače dobyl kopec"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The device lies flat between you; the far side's pieces face its player." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zařízení leží mezi vámi na stole; figury na vzdálenější straně jsou otočené k jejich hráči."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The endgame" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Koncovka"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The engine is off." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Engine je vypnutý."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The engine is still working through the game." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Engine partii ještě prochází."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The engine is thinking…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Engine přemýšlí…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The engine's own first choice" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "První volba enginu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The fifty-move rule: fifty moves by each side with no capture and no pawn move." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pravidlo 50 tahů: padesát tahů každé strany bez braní a bez tahu pěšcem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The five draws" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pět druhů remízy"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The flag fell before the move was made." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Praporek spadl dřív, než padl tah."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The fork" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vidlička"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The four squares both sides are fighting over." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Čtyři pole, o která obě strany bojují."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game ended by resignation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Partie skončila vzdáním."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game review" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rozbor partie"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game waiting under Continue will be lost." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Partie čekající pod tlačítkem Pokračovat bude ztracena."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game would be over before the first move." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Partie by skončila dřív, než by padl první tah."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The gear — in the menu, and in the top row of a game — holds five board themes, sounds and haptics, and the two helpers you may want to switch off as you improve: the legal-move dots and the coordinates around the board." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ozubené kolo — v menu i v horní řadě partie — skrývá pět vzhledů šachovnice, zvuky a vibrace a dva pomocníky, které možná budete chtít s rostoucí silou vypnout: tečky možných tahů a souřadnice kolem šachovnice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The highlighted square is e4." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zvýrazněné pole je e4."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The king" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Král"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The king does not pass over, or land on, a square an enemy piece attacks." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Král nepřechází přes napadené pole ani na něm nekončí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The king has nowhere to run." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Král nemá kam utéct."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The king is not in check right now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Král právě není v šachu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The king is safest behind an untouched wall of pawns, and castling puts him there while bringing a rook towards the centre. As a rule: develop two or three pieces, castle, then start looking for a plan." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Král je nejbezpečnější za nedotčenou hradbou pěšců a rošáda ho tam dostane a zároveň přivede věž ke středu. Jako pravidlo: vyviňte dvě tři figury, zarošujte a teprve pak hledejte plán."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The king moves one square in any direction. He is never actually captured: instead the rules forbid leaving him under attack, so a move that would expose your own king is simply not allowed. The two kings can also never stand next to each other." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Král táhne o jedno pole libovolným směrem. Nikdy se vlastně nebere: pravidla místo toho zakazují nechat ho pod útokem, takže tah, který by vlastního krále vystavil, prostě není dovolen. Oba králové také nikdy nesmějí stát vedle sebe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The king must step aside, and the rook collects the queen." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Král musí uhnout a věž si vezme dámu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The king reached the centre of the board." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Král došel do středu šachovnice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The king reaches the hill — the strongest possible finish." : {
      "comment" : "Review: the move that wins a King of the Hill game",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Král dobývá kopec — silnější zakončení neexistuje."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The knight" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jezdec"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The knight moves in an L: two squares along one line, then one square across. It is the only piece that jumps — nothing in between can block it, and it always lands on a square of the opposite colour to the one it left." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jezdec táhne do L: dvě pole po jedné linii a pak jedno stranou. Je to jediná figura, která skáče — nic mezi tím ji nezastaví — a vždy dopadne na pole opačné barvy, než ze kterého vyšla."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The move that cost the game" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tah, který stál partii"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The one move that held everything together" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jediný tah, který vše udržel pohromadě"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The only move that wins — it forces a win in %lld." : {
      "comment" : "Review, King of the Hill or Three-check; the number is the move the win comes on",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jediný tah, který vyhrává — vynucuje výhru %lld. tahem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The only move that wins — it forces mate in %lld." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jediný tah, který vyhrává — vynucuje mat %lld. tahem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pawn" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pěšec"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pawn captures sideways" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pěšec bere šikmo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The piece-square tables of the Simplified Evaluation Function by Tomasz Michniewski, from the Chess Programming Wiki, used under CC BY-SA 3.0, whose terms are published at:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tabulky hodnot figur na jednotlivých polích ze Simplified Evaluation Function od Tomasze Michniewského, z Chess Programming Wiki, použito pod licencí CC BY-SA 3.0, jejíž podmínky jsou zveřejněny na adrese:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pieces behind the pawns are shuffled — the same way for both sides — so opening theory is no help. Castling still works." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Figury za pěšci se zamíchají — pro obě strany stejně — takže teorie zahájení nepomůže. Rošáda funguje i tak."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pin" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vazba"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The player to move has no legal move." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hráč na tahu nemá žádný možný tah."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The point of the whole game" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O co v celé hře jde"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The queen" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dáma"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The queen is a rook and a bishop in one: any distance along a rank, a file or a diagonal. She is far and away the strongest piece, which is also why she should not go hunting alone in the opening — smaller pieces chase her around and gain time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dáma je věž a střelec v jednom: libovolná vzdálenost po řadě, po sloupci i po diagonále. Je zdaleka nejsilnější figurou, a právě proto by se v zahájení neměla vydávat na lov sama — menší figury ji ženou před sebou a získávají tempo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rook" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Věž"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rook has exactly one legal move: e4, blocking the check." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Věž má přesně jeden možný tah: e4, který šach zacloní."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rows are called ranks and are numbered 1 to 8." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Řady se značí čísly 1 až 8."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rules, from the first move" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pravidla od prvního tahu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same position occurred three times." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stejná pozice nastala potřetí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved game's moves could not be replayed, so it cannot be continued." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tahy uložené partie se nepodařilo přehrát, takže v ní nelze pokračovat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The seconds are added after every move, so quick moves bank time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sekundy se přičtou po každém tahu, takže rychlými tahy si čas našetříte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The side that is not to move is in check." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Strana, která není na tahu, je v šachu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The side to move already has its king on the hill." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Strana na tahu už má krále na kopci."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The side to move is already checkmated." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Strana na tahu už dostala mat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The side to move is stalemated." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Strana na tahu je v patu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The skewer" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Napíchnutí"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The squares between them are empty." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pole mezi nimi jsou volná."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The standard Staunton chess pieces drawn by Cburnett for Wikimedia Commons, used under the BSD licence." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Standardní Stauntonovy šachové figury nakreslil Cburnett pro Wikimedia Commons, použito pod licencí BSD."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The strongest move — it forces a win in %lld." : {
      "comment" : "Review, King of the Hill or Three-check; the number is the move the win comes on",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nejsilnější tah — vynucuje výhru %lld. tahem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The strongest move — it forces mate in %lld." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nejsilnější tah — vynucuje mat %lld. tahem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The strongest move in the position." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nejsilnější tah v pozici."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The third check — the strongest possible finish." : {
      "comment" : "Review: the move that wins a Three-check game",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Třetí šach — silnější zakončení neexistuje."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The third check ends the game." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Třetí šach partii ukončil."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The time a move took is given back afterwards, up to that many seconds." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Čas, který tah zabral, se potom vrátí, nejvýš však tolik sekund."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The two kings face each other on the e-file, the two queens on the d-file." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Oba králové stojí proti sobě na sloupci e, obě dámy na sloupci d."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "THEMES" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TÉMATA"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There are two ways to win: checkmate the enemy king, or have your opponent resign. Resigning is normal courtesy among players once a game is hopeless — the Resign button is in the row under the board." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vyhrát jde dvěma způsoby: dát soupeřovu králi mat, nebo se dočkat, až se soupeř vzdá. Vzdát se je mezi hráči běžná slušnost, jakmile je partie beznadějná — tlačítko Vzdát najdete v řadě pod šachovnicí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no rule that you must take a piece, and no rule that pieces must be defended." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Neexistuje pravidlo, že se musí brát, ani že figury musí být kryté."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There was a forced win in %lld with %@." : {
      "comment" : "Review, King of the Hill or Three-check; the number is the move the win comes on",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Byla tu vynucená výhra %lld. tahem po %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There was mate in %lld with %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Byl tu mat %lld. tahem po %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "thinking" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver: the computer is searching",
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "přemýšlí"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Third check — you lost" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Třetí šach — prohráli jste"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Third check — you win!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Třetí šach — vyhráli jste!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Third check! Black wins" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Třetí šach! Vyhrává černý"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Third check! White wins" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Třetí šach! Vyhrává bílý"
